      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Aspirin, despite being 100-years old, even in the era of evidence-based medicine, remains a valuable analgesic. Results of randomized trials have shown that it is as well effective and safe as other analgesics in relieving mild pain and can be used in the first-line therapy of migraine."},
